      "writtenOn": "2025-09-25T15:08:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I originally was going to disagree with you about this, and site the spec, but re-reading the actual text again, I see the problem for me.\n\nThe spec in that paragraph literally redefines the meaning of `members` to be the set of struct members with `location` defined on them, not all of the struct members, which I hadn\u0027t caught befoe.\n\nI will fix this.",
      "parentUuid": "0f666db8_aaa1a7b4",
